Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The train to Hamburg leaves from platform 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FFFF&}Der Zug nach Hamburg fährt von Gleis 4.{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It is ten minutes late today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.50,0:00:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FFFF&}Er hat heute zehn Minuten Verspätung.{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The bakery next to the station opens at six.\NThey sell fresh rolls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FFFF&}Die Bäckerei am Bahnhof öffnet um sechs.{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FFFF&}Sie verkauft frische Brötchen.{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Rain is coming.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FFFF&}Morgen scheint wieder die Sonne.{\c}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take an umbrella with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H00FFFF&}Gute Reise!{\c}
